WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.960
God, if you are listening, cut taxes for the wealthy.

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:07.980
Help them build data centers in low-income communities.

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:09.760
Reduce regulations.

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:13.440
Speed up the development of artificial general intelligence.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:15.560
I don't want to think anymore.

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:17.740
Computer can think for me.

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:20.120
AI is the future and it is inevitable.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.920
I hope one day they harvest my brain matter.

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:26.100
They pump up all the groundwater.

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:28.520
Mine every rare earth mineral.

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:30.820
and feed it into the internet.

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:32.640
And we merge together

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:35.380
into a singular perfect machine

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:37.700
capable of generating profits

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:41.100
that grow at least 5% year over year.

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:44.140
Think of the synergy we could achieve

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:47.180
with such powerful agentic work shows.

00:00:58.520 --> 00:01:03.280
A delicious and magical surprise of color

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:05.520
It's a great piece

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:07.560
It's very fun and special

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:08.720
No faltes

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:09.380
The Bubba
